(6667205, 997542, 142833, '<td valign="top">I think the paper-wrapped scissors really nails the idea of disguises. The other two items in the photo are a distraction because they don''t really appear to be disguised as anything. The rock is not paper-thin nor is it scissor-shaped. The scissors are not made of rock or paper.</td>', 'I think the paper-wrapped scissors really nails the idea of disguises. The other two items in the photo are a distraction because they don''t really appear to be disguised as anything. The rock is not paper-thin nor is it scissor-shaped. The scissors are not made of rock or paper.', '2012-02-08 09:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6667207, 997317, 142833, '<td valign="top">Funny. :) Love the ''nyah-nyah'' look on the rock to the right. Would''ve liked some depth perhaps by applying some bokeh to this by setting up the background in the distance.</td>', 'Funny. :) Love the ''nyah-nyah'' look on the rock to the right. Would''ve liked some depth perhaps by applying some bokeh to this by setting up the background in the distance.', '2012-02-08 09:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
