(6667271, 997559, 96751, '<td valign="top">Awesome!!!! Hilarious title, which is why I''d have done away entirely with the mother ship at the top.  The sand patterns are fabulous.</td>', 'Awesome!!!! Hilarious title, which is why I''d have done away entirely with the mother ship at the top.  The sand patterns are fabulous.', '2012-02-08 11:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
