(6667277, 997098, 96751, '<td valign="top">Awesome light/setup.  As I''m a stickler for these sorts of shots, there''s much to love.  But a couple of details annoy my particular sensibilities :-)  The shoes are just SO not in the theme of the image, and the closed eyes just shut her down.  I''m not sure about that particular choice, as she is meant to be reading.  And yes, we all blink, but this is about reading, which we cannot do with closed eyes.  Also, this image is BEGGING for a square crop - take out all the dark part at the bottom and a piece at the top.  <br/> <br/>Apologies for my rambling.  Luscious, wonderful image.</td>', 'Awesome light/setup.  As I''m a stickler for these sorts of shots, there''s much to love.  But a couple of details annoy my particular sensibilities :-)  The shoes are just SO not in the theme of the image, and the closed eyes just shut her down.  I''m not sure about that particular choice, as she is meant to be reading.  And yes, we all blink, but this is about reading, which we cannot do with closed eyes.  Also, this image is BEGGING for a square crop - take out all the dark part at the bottom and a piece at the top.   Apologies for my rambling.  Luscious, wonderful image.', '2012-02-08 11:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
