(6677753, 997447, 143086, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by markwiley:</b></div><hr/><i> Imagine what score you might have gotten if you would have cleaned that window before hand. Another fascinating capture, John. Congrats on the HM. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>A clean window would have probably lowered my score. Congrats on the awesome photo</td>', 'Originally posted by markwiley: Imagine what score you might have gotten if you would have cleaned that window before hand. Another fascinating capture, John. Congrats on the HM.  A clean window would have probably lowered my score. Congrats on the awesome photo', '2012-02-15 11:14:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(6677756, 997098, 143086, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tanguera:</b></div><hr/><i> Awesome light/setup.  As I''m a stickler for these sorts of shots, there''s much to love.  But a couple of details annoy my particular sensibilities :-)  The shoes are just SO not in the theme of the image, and the closed eyes just shut her down.  I''m not sure about that particular choice, as she is meant to be reading.  And yes, we all blink, but this is about reading, which we cannot do with closed eyes.  Also, this image is BEGGING for a square crop - take out all the dark part at the bottom and a piece at the top.  <br/> <br/>Apologies for my rambling.  Luscious, wonderful image. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>My thoughts almost exactly. The shoes and the crop and the gaze. Thanks for sharing the image!</td>', 'Originally posted by tanguera: Awesome light/setup.  As I''m a stickler for these sorts of shots, there''s much to love.  But a couple of details annoy my particular sensibilities :-)  The shoes are just SO not in the theme of the image, and the closed eyes just shut her down.  I''m not sure about that particular choice, as she is meant to be reading.  And yes, we all blink, but this is about reading, which we cannot do with closed eyes.  Also, this image is BEGGING for a square crop - take out all the dark part at the bottom and a piece at the top.   Apologies for my rambling.  Luscious, wonderful image.  My thoughts almost exactly. The shoes and the crop and the gaze. Thanks for sharing the image!', '2012-02-15 11:18:59.000000', NULL, 0),
