(6678370, 997091, 27812, '<td valign="top">Be careful if you use an action or whateva, you do not know what is hidden in there. I still don''t but must assume the thingy had vignette in it. My mistake and really mine alone. <br/>First disqualification in all my time. Suppose I had to feel what it sis like.<br/> <br/>Still love the image and still believe that it might/could have been done without the ''stir fry-mix''I used in Lightroom. A slight re-crop for example. Too bad. Sad. But correct application of the rules.<br/> <br/>Sorry.</td>', 'Be careful if you use an action or whateva, you do not know what is hidden in there. I still don''t but must assume the thingy had vignette in it. My mistake and really mine alone. First disqualification in all my time. Suppose I had to feel what it sis like. Still love the image and still believe that it might/could have been done without the ''stir fry-mix''I used in Lightroom. A slight re-crop for example. Too bad. Sad. But correct application of the rules. Sorry.', '2012-02-15 18:43:27.000000', NULL, 0),
