(6678485, 997570, 142483, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by The_Tourist:</b></div><hr/><i> Umm, okay. Butt where''s the rock and paper?<br/>I think you needed some TP between the buns and some simulated family jewels between the legs.<br/>Have to take a guess that this is sinistral_leo and his toy.  Hilarious, can''t wait to read the comments on this.<br/>The_Tourist </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Now THAT was an amazing suggestion... tp between the cheeks would''ve really set this image apart!! chuck some rocks on the ground and wah-lah, you''ve covered all three aspects lol<br/> <br/>For what it''s worth, I gave this an 8... TP would''ve brought it to a 10 for sure lol</td>', 'Originally posted by The_Tourist: Umm, okay. Butt where''s the rock and paper?I think you needed some TP between the buns and some simulated family jewels between the legs.Have to take a guess that this is sinistral_leo and his toy.  Hilarious, can''t wait to read the comments on this.The_Tourist   Now THAT was an amazing suggestion... tp between the cheeks would''ve really set this image apart!! chuck some rocks on the ground and wah-lah, you''ve covered all three aspects lol For what it''s worth, I gave this an 8... TP would''ve brought it to a 10 for sure lol', '2012-02-15 20:19:24.000000', NULL, 0),
