(6678796, 997447, 143062, '<td valign="top">This is such a cool shot. <br/> <br/>I just imagined another idea for a similar shot where the shutter speed is much slower so that the person will be out of focus due to motion blur (1/5s). But the mirror if held at the same plane will render the mirrored image in focus (as it does not really move in relation to the camera on a tripod).</td>', 'This is such a cool shot.  I just imagined another idea for a similar shot where the shutter speed is much slower so that the person will be out of focus due to motion blur (1/5s). But the mirror if held at the same plane will render the mirrored image in focus (as it does not really move in relation to the camera on a tripod).', '2012-02-16 02:44:20.000000', NULL, 0),
